 deeptools/correlation.py           |  9 +++---
 deeptools/test/test_correlation.py | 50 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 58 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 deeptools/test/test_correlation.py

